+Table~\ref{tab:judge-cost} summarizes the nine production judge runs on the full 300-record pool. The 2,688 logged calls produced 2,683 verdicts and five failures. Input/output columns report recorded token counts; call time sums all event latencies (including failures), rather than elapsed wall-clock time.
